# Git Workflow

## Push Policy

**NEVER run `git push` without explicit user approval.**

- Committing locally is fine.
- When asked only to commit, stop after `git commit` and show the commit hash/message.
- Only push after the user explicitly says "push", "go ahead", "deploy", or similar confirmation.
- "Commit and push" in a single message IS that confirmation — do both, without stopping to re-confirm.
